OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMusic by Britten and Bridge
OL,11,     Gperformed live by one of Radio
OL,12,     G3's New Generation Artists, and
OL,13,     Galso this week, exclusive concert
OL,14,     Grecordings of distinctive
OL,15,     Gsettings of the church mass.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,17,     GKate Molleson charts the
OL,18,     Ginfluences upon the early
OL,19,     Gsymphonies of Sibelius, including
OL,20,     Gthe romantic symphonic music of
OL,21,     GTchaikovsky, and themes of
OL,22,     GNationalism.
